# GoPrepared Monorepo

- **go-prepared-app** — Flutter (Android, iOS, Web PWA)
- **go-prepared-api** — Spring Boot + Spring AI (runtime inference only)
- **go-prepared-content** — Python CLI batch generator (never HTTP at request time)
- **contracts/ai/** — JSON Schema for all AI outputs

Never commit secrets. Docs go in `Docs/`.
